00:19:00,899 --> 00:19:07,060
To expand our own idea of service. because, you know, if you, if you just have a blanket prohibition,

214
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:10,300
Nobody can do this and qualify it as a service project.

215
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:13,500
Well, you've missed. you've missed the point of the whole thing.

216
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:19,740
You've missed the opportunity to have a discussion with the scout who may tell you something that you don't know now.

217
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:25,500
A moment ago, We were discussing the idea that opportunities for service need to be like a meaning Eagle project.

218
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:28,060
I don't think I've read the riot act recently,

