00:19:28,820 --> 00:19:38,340
But according to the guide to advancement, no council, committee, district, unit or individual has the authority to add to or

220
00:19:38,899 --> 00:19:40,899
Subtract from advancement requirements,

221
00:19:41,780 --> 00:19:44,899
Requiring that this be like a mini Eagle Scout project.

